seq - print consecutive integers

SYNOPSIS
    seq [first] last

DESCRIPTION
    Print the nonnegative decimal integers from first through last, one per
    line. If first is omitted, start at 1. A last value below first produces
    no lines.

SEE ALSO
    printf(1), sh(1), yes(1)
